      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i'll try to separate them. i'm just worried about audits. sometimes it feels like money just disappears or things don't add up at the end of the month and i can't figure out where the leak is. how do people usually prepare for an audit so they don't get caught off guard by small discrepancies?",
